# RULockedIn Change Log

## Iteration 1

Feature 1: User signup with input validation. [commit aba6cfa](https://github.com/faithnyambane/RULockedIn/commit/aba6cfa)
Feature 2: User login and logout with session management. [commit aba6cfa](https://github.com/faithnyambane/RULockedIn/commit/aba6cfa)

## Iteration 2

Feature 3: Chat with LLM as guest or logged-in user. [commit d7b49fd](https://github.com/faithnyambane/RULockedIn/commit/d7b49fd)
Feature 4: Save conversation history to MongoDB. [commit d7b49fd](https://github.com/faithnyambane/RULockedIn/commit/d7b49fd)
Feature 5: Continue a past conversation. [commit d7b49fd](https://github.com/faithnyambane/RULockedIn/commit/d7b49fd)
Feature 6: Search conversation history by keyword. [commit 6c2d892](https://github.com/faithnyambane/RULockedIn/commit/6c2d892)
Feature 7: Cucumber.js acceptance tests and Puppeteer E2E tests. [PR 1](https://github.com/faithnyambane/RULockedIn/pull/1)

## Iteration 3

Feature 8: Select backend LLM model via dropdown UI. [PR #4](https://github.com/faithnyambane/RULockedIn/pull/4)
Feature 9: Local model support via Ollama. [PR #4](https://github.com/faithnyambane/RULockedIn/pull/4)
Feature 10: Side-by-side model comparison. [PR #4](https://github.com/faithnyambane/RULockedIn/pull/4)
Feature 11: Iteration 3 unit tests (Jasmine). [PR #5](https://github.com/faithnyambane/RULockedIn/pull/5)
Feature 12: ESLint CI/CD pipeline fix. [commit a5e62ae](https://github.com/faithnyambane/RULockedIn/commit/a5e62ae)